
# ── Subject: type(scope): summary in imperative mood (max ~60 chars, no period) ──
# e.g. feat(social): add meetup room creation API
#      fix(account): allow re-submission after rejection
#
# type : feat | fix | refactor | test | docs | chore | ci
# scope: account | social | ui | common | infra   (omit for docs-only changes)
#
# ── Leave one blank line, then the body: what changed and why ──
#
# ── Related issue at the very end: Closes #12 ──
#
# Lines starting with '#' are ignored. An empty message aborts the commit.
# Team language on GitHub is English. See docs/team/TEAM_GUIDE.md
